{
  "id": 458585059,
  "iid": 23681,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "Multipart: End looping when CRLF is missing",
  "description": "If the last CRLF is missing (due to fuzzed data or whatever),\nmark the current field as the last field so that the loop ends.\nAlso don't claim that the current line has length 0, but make it\nthe length to the end of the captured data. (Previously it set it\nto -1, which had that effect.)\n\nFixup 040f360553484151d6de7ead1537186e7afaca8d\n\nFix #21030\n\nAI-Assisted: no",
